</li>
<li><p><strong><a href="https://huggingface.co/Infatoshi/GLM-5.3-UNCENSORED-EXL3-3.0bpw">Infatoshi/GLM-5.3-UNCENSORED-EXL3-3.0bpw</a></strong>
